<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #4285F4;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 30px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333333;
        }

        .btn-wrap {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .button {
            background-color: #4285F4;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777777;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Welcome to Our App!</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
            <p>Thanks for signing up with your Google account! We're excited to have you on board.</p>
            <p>You now have full access to our platform. Click the button below to head over to your dashboard and get
                started.</p>
            <div class="btn-wrap">
                <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="button">Go to Dashboard</a>
            </div>
            <p>If you didn't sign up for this account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
            <p>Cheers,<br>The Team</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Your App Name. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>